{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToPreviewAndTest","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService"],"title":"How-to Guides","generated":true,"anchor":"How-to-Guides"}],"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtopreviewandtest"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drive "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" from SwiftUI previews and Swift Testing suites without touching Mixpanel’s network."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" calls into a real ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelInstance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For previews and tests, swap it for ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — an actor that records every call and exposes its history for assertions. The mock has no Mixpanel dependency and runs offline.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"In a SwiftUI preview","type":"heading","anchor":"In-a-SwiftUI-preview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Inject a mock-backed store and the analytics work flows without spinning up the SDK:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["#Preview {","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: MockMixpanelAnalyticsService())","    return ContentView().environment(store)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This requires that ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppStore.configured","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" accepts an injected ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". See Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" guide for the factory pattern.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"In-a-Swift-Testing-suite","text":"In a Swift Testing suite","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the mock to verify mapper behavior. Await the plugin’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flush()"},{"type":"text","text":" to make assertions deterministic:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","import Testing","","@Test","func incrementMapsToCounterAdded() async {","    let mock = MockMixpanelAnalyticsService()","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: mock)","","    store.send(.counter(.increment(5)))","    await store.analyticsPlugin.flush()","","    let events = await mock.trackedEvents","    #expect(events.first?.name == \"counter_added\")","    #expect(events.first?.properties[\"amount\"] == .int(5))","}"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Asserting-on-identify-and-alias","level":2,"text":"Asserting on identify and alias"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The mock records identify and alias calls in order:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@Test","func userSignInIdentifies() async {","    let mock = MockMixpanelAnalyticsService()","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: mock)","","    store.send(.auth(.signIn(userID: \"user-1\")))","    await store.analyticsPlugin.flush()","","    let calls = await mock.identifyCalls","    #expect(calls == [.init(userID: \"user-1\", properties: [\"tier\": .string(\"free\")])])","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" is an actor, so its accessors are async — wrap them in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"await"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"How to Preview and Test"},"references":{"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MockServiceReference":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference","role":"article","kind":"article","title":"Mock Service Reference","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"API reference for "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" — a recording "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" for SwiftUI previews and Swift Testing suites."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mockservicereference"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Recording ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for previews and Swift Testing suites.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mockmixpanelanalyticsservice","kind":"symbol","title":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","kind":"identifier"}]},"https://heirloomlogic.github.io/Swidux/documentation/swidux/howtoaddanalytics":{"url":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add Analytics"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","title":"Add Analytics"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","abstract":[{"text":"Mixpanel adapter for Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Owns the Mixpanel SDK on the app’s behalf — ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService(token:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mixpanel.initialize","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" internally so apps never need to ","type":"text"},{"code":"import Mixpanel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Ships a recording mock for previews and tests.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/GettingStarted":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","role":"article","title":"Getting Started with SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, build ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with your token, register the analytics plugin, and start dispatching events.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/gettingstarted"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/HowToImplementService":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","role":"article","title":"How to Implement the Service","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Configure ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to match your privacy, residency, and batching needs — without ","type":"text"},{"code":"import Mixpanel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in your app.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtoimplementservice"}}}